{'symbol': 'DISH', 'date': '2022-05-06 06:05:00', 'title': 'DISH NETWORK REPORTS FIRST QUARTER 2022 FINANCIAL RESULTS', 'text': 'ENGLEWOOD, COLO. , MAY 6, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DISH NETWORK CORPORATION (NASDAQ: DISH) REPORTED REVENUE TOTALING $4.33 BILLION FOR THE QUARTER ENDING MARCH 31, 2022, COMPARED TO $4.50 BILLION FOR THE CORRESPONDING PERIOD IN 2021.'}